<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings down in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings down in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended July 26, roastings totaled approximately 315,000 60-kg bags, down from 320,000 bags the previous week and compared with 370,000 bags in the corresponding week one year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 9,750,000 60-kg bags, versus 9,590,000 bags in the same year ago period.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
